solution "To find the image of the triangle under the action of $T$, we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of the triangle:\n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under the action of $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & -5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the image's vertices are $(-1,1)$, $(-5,5),$ $(-3,3).$ Notice that all three points lie on the same line.\n\nSo, the image of our triangle under the action of $T$ is as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993138/assets/cf336b4522756131aeb6dd9bc48ada6f8b255526b6ae20120dcf40f155b1b95c.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-147649/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7d1252e9-f2ac-5adf-9cf5-ef48e35fb747"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-147649"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-21058/selection/73a067e409f8b0b513e777fbd6643dce0c01f75839ed4226a982d940ba646f0d" :answer/id #uuid "8d644d07-29d0-5333-9cfb-385c8a57b415" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993138/assets/cac3c2b4fb6191aa9a523b445d8533774f438d24556ea79b8e67a4d6c3867526.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-21058/selection/71119c98d1709789485bf9c50925d76172e6158775f901a0f1f432772097e1de" :answer/id #uuid "60255902-4e57-574e-81c9-8fb476bbed2c" :answer/type :answer.type/image :answer/value "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993138/assets/52266ff97300b29c85ac14f5b60b308d9e8a0e2fe3a01e8e0431b643e6a28922.png" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-210